# stark_app options, shown in the single STARK menu: main/Kconfig.projbuild
# sources this file (ARCHITECTURE.md §9).

config STARK_APP_WORKER_STACK
    int "App worker stack (bytes)"
    range 2048 16384
    default 4096
    help
        Stack of the running app's one background worker (a static slot:
        reserved at build time, whether or not an app uses it).
        ARCHITECTURE.md §6.8, §8.

config STARK_APP_WORKER_PRIO
    int "App worker priority"
    range 1 4
    default 4
    help
        FreeRTOS priority of the worker task; below the UI task's 5 so a
        busy worker never starves the UI.

config STARK_APP_WORKER_JOIN_MS
    int "App worker join timeout (ms)"
    range 100 10000
    default 1000
    help
        How long stopping an app waits for its worker to return before the
        task is deleted anyway (a contract violation, logged and counted).
